Third Party source code has been subtree'd into this repo:

---------------------------
--Simple-Websocket-Server--
---------------------------
Initial Add
$ git subtree add --prefix prod/common/Simple-WebSocket-Server https://gitlab.com/eidheim/Simple-WebSocket-Server v2.0.0-rc2 --squash

Had to patch to get rid of error
$ git apply patch/Simple-WebSocket-Server.patch

Example Update
$ git subtree pull --prefix prod/common/Simple-WebSocket-Server https://gitlab.com/eidheim/Simple-WebSocket-Server v2.0.0-rc4 --squash
